  "_comment": "Official manuals the manufacturers publish openly on their own domains, ingested by `npm run ingest:web-manuals`. Only vendor-hosted PDFs: no university mirrors or manual-sharing sites. Agilent and Restek block automated clients and Malvern Panalytical, Bruker, Wyatt, JASCO, Rigaku, Renishaw, Denton, CEM and Mettler Toledo keep manuals behind customer logins, so those must be uploaded by an admin (Admin -> Documents). Every entry was checked against the host's robots.txt on 2026-10-27: hosts that forbid bots (knauer.ninoxdb.com) or refuse them (documents./tools.thermofisher.com) are not used; Thermo manuals come from knowledge1/assets.thermofisher.com, which permit it. waters.com and tainstruments.com time out from some networks; re-run from another one if they fail. Researched 2026-10-27.",
